## Security Considerations

- Player contacts stored server-side (in player-mail/<guid>/contacts)
- Server can technically read all messages (it has the contacts files)
- For true E2E encryption, clients would need local key storage
- Current design: server-mediated encryption (server is trusted relay)

For paranoid mode (future):
- Client generates keypair, stores private key locally
- Only public key shared with server
- True E2E, server can't read messages

